### GET request to example server (expect 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animals

### POST request to add a new animal as admin user (expect 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/animals
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buddy",
  "species": "Dog",
  "age": 3,
  "birthDate": "2025-10-14 12:00:00"
}

### POST request to add a new animal as anonymous user (expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/animals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buddy",
  "species": "Dog",
  "age": 3
}


### PUT request to update an animal as admin user (expect 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/animals/4
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=  # admin:admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Max",
    "species": "Dog",
    "age": 4,
  "birthDate": "2022-05-20 12:00:00",
  "createdAt": "2022-01-01T10:00:00"

}

### PUT request to update an animal as user (expect 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/animals/7
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNzd29yZA==  # user:password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 5

}

### DELETE (http client) - as anonymous (expect 401 Unauthorized)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/animals/5

Accept: application/json

###

### DELETE (http client) - as admin (expect 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/animals/4
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
Accept: application/json

###

### 1️⃣ DELETE as anonymous (no auth)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/animals/5
Accept: application/json

###

### 2️⃣ DELETE as regular user (expect 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/animals/5
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNzd29yZA==  # user:password
Accept: application/json

###

### 3️⃣ DELETE as admin (expect 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/animals/5
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=  # admin:admin
Accept: application/json
